# "Whenever a Dragon you control enters": on turn 2 Bot2 casts Nova Hellkite, a Dragon under its control, and Sarkhan does not
# trigger - he stays a 2/2 human with no flying (the Hellkite's enters trigger pings him for 1, shown as 1 damage). The control
# is the first Sarkhan scenario, where Bot1's own Hellkite makes him a 3/3 Dragon.

